      "text": "My interview with Frank Klein and Dr. Brad Clevenger premieres 30 minutes before the market opens! 🚀\n\nhttps://youtu.be/CIMQvRFW2y0\n\nI’m excited for you all to see this conversation from my visit to Mynaric in Germany.\n\nI recorded an introduction to give you some context from the visit. It’s a little longer than I originally planned, but the factory tour will be released separately after Rocket Lab has reviewed it, so I felt that context was worth including ahead of the interview.\n\nA huge thank you to Rocket Lab for organizing the visit, and to Frank and Brad for taking the time to speak with me.\n\nLooking forward to hearing what you think!\n\n@RocketLab \n\n#RocketLab #Mynaric #RKLB",
